BENCH-ONLY GPU timing instrumentation (pass timers summed per frame). Not part of the fix; not intended for upstream.
diff --git a/app/streaming/video/ffmpeg-renderers/plvk.cpp b/app/streaming/video/ffmpeg-renderers/plvk.cpp
